This repository contains build notes and a small patch to setup.py of
opencv-python (https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python), which is licensed
under the MIT License below.

The wheel files attached to the Releases of this repository contain OpenCV,
which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0, plus third-party libraries.
Their full licence texts are inside each wheel (LICENSE.txt and
LICENSE-3RD-PARTY.txt in the installed package folder).

